# What EAS must not carry to the cloud.
#
# EAS uses this file in place of .gitignore when it is present, so everything
# that should stay behind has to be listed here - not just the new things.
#
# This exists because a local Gradle build leaves 1.9 GB in android/, and
# without it the project archive went from 2.4 MB to 550 MB and the upload
# was reset halfway. Worse than the size: EAS runs its own prebuild, so a
# local android/ is at best ignored and at worst used, and the local one is
# configured to sign with the debug keystore.

# Native projects: build output, regenerated in the cloud from app.json.
android/
ios/

# Restored on the build machine from package-lock.json.
node_modules/

# Local caches and artefacts.
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

.env
*.log
.DS_Store
